1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,261
Four hours. One page.

2
00:00:02,511 --> 00:00:03,586
It's a big page.

3
00:00:03,616 --> 00:00:04,815
It's a map.

4
00:00:05,365 --> 00:00:06,280
It's a good map.

5
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,425
Go home, Dev.

6
00:00:07,455 --> 00:00:08,642
Not till ten.

7
00:00:09,092 --> 00:00:10,056
Why ten.

8
00:00:10,086 --> 00:00:11,531
Mum's not back till ten.

9
00:00:11,561 --> 00:00:12,459
And?

10
00:00:13,909 --> 00:00:15,582
And it's too quiet at home.

11
00:00:15,632 --> 00:00:16,840
Then it's not quiet.

12
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:17,880
What are you doing.

13
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:18,854
Reading.

14
00:00:19,604 --> 00:00:20,897
We're closed.

15
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:23,520
We're still open.
